            <abstract>
                <p>
                    This is the short recension of the <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1925Mashaf">Maṣḥafa falāsfā ṭabibān</ref>.
                    This recension is different from <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7145MFTabiban">Maṣḥafa falāsfā ṭabibān</ref>,
                    especially in the second part of the work ((see <bibl>
                        <ptr target="bm:Zotenberg1877Catalogue"/>
                        <citedRange unit="page">260-261</citedRange>.
                    </bibl>).
                </p>
            </abstract>
